		<language name="English">Fin de la communication.\nVeuillez patienter...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0014_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Veuillez choisir les Pokémon\ndevant participer.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0014_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} doit effectuer son choix.</language>
